# Mobile API auth

- Production path: `GET /auth/challenge` → attested `POST /auth/register` → `POST /auth/token` → content GETs with short-lived install JWT (`iid`).
- Production: `require_app_attestation=true`, `accept_shared_bearer=false`. Shared `tr_mob_…` is staging-only.
- If no Mobile API Token (`tr_mobile_app_key`) is set, fail closed (`503`).
- Compromising one phone → revoke that install only; do not force global key rotation for every user.
- Content routes never accept raw secrets via query string.
- Keep page/limit caps (`limit` ≤ 20, posts page ≤ 50, search page ≤ 10); register ≤ 5/hour/IP.
- Do not run `the_content` on API bodies; keep `wp_kses_post`.
- Password-protected posts must not appear in list/detail/search.
- Cloudflare is the real DDoS control. Attestation stops casual clones; do not claim clone apps are impossible.
- Keep attestation on free platform APIs only (Play Integrity + App Attest). No paid App Check / reCAPTCHA Enterprise / Approov. Default: Integrity on register only, not every `/auth/token`.
